      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caneadea%2C_New_York",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Caneadea grew from a Seneca reservation ceded after the American Revolution, ending in 1826.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
