      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caneadea%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Genesee Valley Canal ran through Caneadea starting in 1851, spawning businesses that served canal traffic.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
